{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46313","headline":"蝴蝶 · 齐己","name":"蝴蝶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处背繁红，迷芳到槛重。\n分飞还独出，成队偶相逢。\n远害终防雀，争先不避蜂。\n桃蹊牵往复，兰径引相从。\n翠裛丹心冷，香凝粉翅浓。\n可寻穿树影，难觅宿花踪。\n日晚来仍急，春残舞未慵。\n西风旧池馆，犹得采芙蓉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}